"""VELDORIA - a travel poster for a place that does not exist.

The poster shows the twin crystal spires of Veldoria rising from a calm
sea at sunset, a lone sailboat, and a pine headland in the foreground.
The place name VELDORIA is set in large letters across the top of the
picture, so the eye travels from the name down to the spires and the sun
on the horizon.

The program writes the poster as /output/entry.png (or to the directory
named by MAKEFUN_OUTPUT_DIR when that is set). It is fully deterministic
and needs no network: the poster bytes are embedded below, produced by a
procedural drawing script written in this same session.
"""

